 pve-qemu-kvm (11.1.3-1) trixie; urgency=medium
 
   * update to QEMU 11.1.3, including fixes for KVM, CPU and device emulation,
     networking and storage. Fix block-layer data corruption and improve
     reporting of flush errors when closing disks and converting images with
     qemu-img.
 
   * cpu flags: expose the pmu flag in the custom CPU flag dialog, allowing the
     virtual performance monitoring unit required by Windows VBS to be enabled
     for named CPU models.
